# Bytes a pull request may grow the linux/amd64 release binary over its base,
# checked by `make size-growth-check` in CI. The number counts only while the
# pull request edits this file; otherwise the allowance is 16384 bytes.
# A pull request that needs more sets the bytes here and says why in a comment above them.
# #3888 follow-ups: the companion update watches the new app in the process
# list and puts the earlier one back, one folder lock covers every companion
# writer, and the update check keeps the newer of two answers.
# The linux/amd64 release build grows by 20480 bytes.
20480
